-## Service / Registry Layer
-
-Data is persisted in YAML/JSON files. Registries follow this pattern:
-
-```python
-import yaml
-from app.core.config import settings
-
-class MyResourceRegistry:
-    def __init__(self, path: str | None = None):
-        self.path = path or settings.MY_RESOURCE_REGISTRY
-        self._ensure()
-
-    def _ensure(self):
-        if not os.path.exists(self.path):
-            self._write({"resources": {}})
-
-    def _read(self) -> dict:
-        with open(self.path, "r", encoding="utf-8") as f:
-            return yaml.safe_load(f) or {"resources": {}}
-
-    def _write(self, data: dict):
-        with open(self.path, "w", encoding="utf-8") as f:
-            yaml.safe_dump(data, f, allow_unicode=True, sort_keys=False)
-
-    def list(self) -> list[dict]: ...
-    def get(self, id: str) -> dict | None: ...
-    def add_or_update(self, item: dict) -> dict: ...
-    def remove(self, id: str): ...
-```
