-# DataFlow Development Expert
-
-When working in a DataFlow repository, you have access to deep architectural knowledge.
-
-## Known Issue Diagnostics
-
-| Error keyword | Issue | Fix |
-|---|---|---|
-| `Unexpected key 'xxx' in operator` | #001 — param naming (warning only) | Rename param to match operator signature |
-| `No object named 'Xxx' found in 'operators' registry` | #002 — missing `__init__.py` TYPE_CHECKING declaration | Add to `TYPE_CHECKING` block in `__init__.py` |
-| `Key Matching Error` / `does not match any output keys` | #003 — pipeline key mismatch | Ensure `output_key` of step N matches `input_key` of step N+1 |
-| `You must call storage.step() before` | #004 — missing `storage.step()` | Add `storage=self.storage.step()` to each `run()` call |
-| `DummyStorage` + `AttributeError` | #005 — DummyStorage API limits | Use real `FileStorage` for testing |
-| `AttributeError: 'NoneType'` + `re.split` | #006 — capture group in `re.split` | Replace `(...)` with `(?:...)` in pattern |
-| `@prompt_restrict` not working | #007 — decorator position | Place `@prompt_restrict` immediately above class definition |
-| `additionalProperties is required to be false` / API 500 infinite retry | #009 — json_schema missing additionalProperties | Add `"additionalProperties": False` to every `"type": "object"` in json_schema |
-
-## Architecture Quick Reference
-
-```
-DataFlow/
-├── dataflow/
-│   ├── operators/          # All operator implementations
-│   │   ├── core_text/      # Text processing operators
-│   │   ├── knowledge_cleaning/  # KBC operators
-│   │   └── base.py         # OperatorABC base class
-│   ├── serving/            # LLM serving backends
-│   │   └── __init__.py     # APILLMServing_request, etc.
-│   ├── utils/
-│   │   ├── storage.py      # FileStorage
-│   │   └── registry.py     # OPERATOR_REGISTRY, PROMPT_REGISTRY
-│   ├── prompts/            # Prompt templates
-│   │   └── core_text.py    # FormatStrPrompt, DIYPromptABC
-│   └── pipeline.py         # PipelineABC
-```
-
-## Pipeline Code Review Checklist (14 items)
-
-**Operator level:**
-- [ ] Inherits `OperatorABC`; calls `super().__init__()`
-- [ ] `@OPERATOR_REGISTRY.register()` decorator
-- [ ] `run()` has `input_*`/`output_*`/`storage` params
-- [ ] `run()` returns list of output key names
-- [ ] `storage.read()` and `storage.write()` both present
-- [ ] LLM operator: `self.llm_serving` (not `self.llm`, `self.model`, etc.)
-- [ ] Per-row `try/except` with fallback value
-- [ ] `<think>` tag stripping where appropriate
-- [ ] `get_desc(lang)` with `zh`/`en` support
-
-**Pipeline level:**
-- [ ] Each `run()` call uses `storage=self.storage.step()`
-- [ ] Field dependencies satisfied (no forward references)
-- [ ] No unused imports
-- [ ] `first_entry_file_name` points to actual data file
-- [ ] `if __name__ == "__main__":` entry point present
-
